  </order>
  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>DFT-load_map_code_map
The standard OMOP procedure for every code in map.code_usage, in this order:
1. standard vocabulary code -&gt; its valid 'Maps to' standard concept(s)
2. local code, or standard code the vocabulary cannot map -&gt; reviewed row in cdm.source_to_concept_map
3. nothing found -&gt; concept 0 with the reason, listed in map.unmapped_codes
Refused rows go to adm.map_load_reject.</note>
